# S Language — 30 Day Completion Plan

Goal: usable, strong, daily-driver for S apps offline.
Not "world's only unbreakable crypto" — strongest *practical* own stack.

## Week 1 — Language complete feel
- Day 1–2: JSON + HTTP in Slib (real file/net basics)
- Day 3–4: Type checker expansion (int/str/bool/opt)
- Day 5–7: 100+ tests, fix edge bugs, s new polish

## Week 2 — Ship path
- Day 8–10: s build → dist/ with .sbx + runner script
- Day 11–12: S Shield v2 (done baseline) + multi-check
- Day 13–14: Docs in .sd, examples gallery

## Week 3 — Power + safety
- Day 15–17: Deeper static check, freeze defaults option
- Day 18–19: SVM parity gaps
- Day 20–21: LSP polish already started

## Week 4 — Harden + freeze release
- Day 22–24: Anti-tamper fail-closed everywhere sbx runs
- Day 25–26: Performance passes, doctor release gate
- Day 27–28: Sample apps (shop, todo, calc)
- Day 29–30: V3.0 freeze, zip, changelog

## Protection truth (industry-aligned)
- Integrity fail → app stops (our law)
- Signature / hash checks on Android when APK path exists
- Secrets on server
- No malware against analysts' PCs
